# Chicken Egg from CLUCK!, the hidden chicken quest in Westfall.
# Sources: quests.json (CLUCK! 3861: Alliance races, Skyborne included;
# repeatable; its text); items.json (the egg is looted from the Farm Chicken
# Egg object, the feed from Farmer Saldean); Forever's quest page for 3861;
# the quest notes (data/local/mechanics: buy the feed first, a chicken that
# is not friendly yet is attacked by a right-click, any chicken takes the
# feed); Forever client 1.60.1.70532 (25 copper feed).

step Special Chicken Feed
  tip Buy one Special Chicken Feed (25 copper) from Farmer Saldean at his farm first: it is not a quest item, and the chicken stays friendly only for a short while.
  buy 11109 npc 233                   -- Special Chicken Feed

step CLUCK!
  tip Target one of the chickens around Saldean's farm and type /chicken at it, again and again, until it offers CLUCK!; this can take several minutes. Then /cheer at a chicken until it turns friendly (green) and hand in the feed; right-clicking a chicken before it is friendly attacks it. The chicken lays an egg on the ground: loot it for your Chicken Egg.
  accept 3861 @56.1,30
  turnin 3861 @56.1,30
  collect 11110 @56.1,30              -- Loot the Farm Chicken Egg the chicken lays
